# These files require a UTF-8 BOM to be parsed as UTF-8 by Windows tools:
# PowerShell 5.1 reads BOM-less .ps1 as ANSI, and NSIS reads BOM-less .nsi as ACP,
# so non-ASCII comments break parsing. Disable line-ending conversion so the BOM
# and the original line endings are never rewritten.
*.ps1 -text
*.nsi -text
